[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3194387985","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109681#issuecomment-3194387985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109681","id":3194387985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-Zn4R","user":{"login":"aitorciki","id":428243,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODI0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/428243?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki","html_url":"https://github.com/aitorciki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aitorciki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-17T13:28:56Z","updated_at":"2025-08-17T21:16:46Z","body":"Seems to bisect to a317ce75a6 based on my custom builds.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3194387985/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243266330","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109681#issuecomment-3243266330","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109681","id":3243266330,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BUFEa","user":{"login":"jason-cahill","id":49805405,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODA1NDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49805405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-cahill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T21:17:06Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T21:17:06Z","body":"I'm running into this as well on 4.5 B6. I have an AppleScript that brings Godot to the foreground if it's running, or switches to Desktop 1 and launches Godot if it's not running. Godot always forcibly switches to the Desktop where Finder is running (I run Finder in fullscreen), so the Godot launcher is sitting atop Finder in a fullscreen space. This is a frustrating regression.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243266330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243305056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109681#issuecomment-3243305056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109681","id":3243305056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BUOhg","user":{"login":"jason-cahill","id":49805405,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODA1NDA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49805405?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill","html_url":"https://github.com/jason-cahill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jason-cahill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-01T21:58:01Z","updated_at":"2025-09-01T22:02:16Z","body":"OK -- I've found a workaround. It's gross, but reliable. I will live with this if this bug cannot be fixed in the 4.5 dev cycle. I have the following AppleScript. It assumes that you've configured Mission Control's keyboard shortcut to Ctrl+Option+Cmd 1 to Show Desktop 1 and have enabled it.\n\n```\ntell application \"System Events\"\n\tif exists (processes where name contains \"Godot\") then\n\t\t-- Godot is running, just activate it\n\t\tset frontmost of first process whose name contains \"Godot\" to true\n\telse\n\t\t-- Godot is not running, switch to Desktop and launch it\n\t\tkey code 18 using {control down, option down, command down} -- Ctrl+Option+Cmd+1\n\t\tdelay 0.5 -- Wait for space switch to complete\n\t\t\n\t\t-- Open root directory for the workaround (safer than home folder)\n\t\tdo shell script \"open /\"\n\t\tdelay 0.1\n\n\t\t-- launch in current space\n\t\tdo shell script \"open '/Applications/Godot.app'\"\n\t\t\n\t\t-- Wait a moment for Godot to start launching\n\t\tdelay 0.25\n\t\t\n\t\t-- Close the root directory Finder window using System Events\n\t\ttell application \"System Events\"\n\t\t\ttell process \"Finder\"\n\t\t\t\ttry\n\t\t\t\t\t-- Look for a window with \"/\" in the title and close it\n\t\t\t\t\tset finderWindows to every window\n\t\t\t\t\trepeat with aWindow in finderWindows\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif name of aWindow contains \"/\" or name of aWindow is equal to \"Macintosh HD\" then\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclick button 1 of aWindow -- close button\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\texit repeat\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend if\n\t\t\t\t\tend repeat\n\t\t\t\tend try\n\t\t\tend tell\n\t\tend tell\n\t\t\n\t\t-- Force Godot to the front and ensure we stay on this space\n\t\tif exists (processes where name contains \"Godot\") then\n\t\t\tset frontmost of first process whose name contains \"Godot\" to true\n\t\tend if\n\tend if\nend tell\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243305056/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]